{
  "name": "Grasping Shot",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When this projectile strikes its target, transmutation magic turns it into grasping, poisonous brambles, which wrap around the target. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x your Proficiency extra poison damage, its Speed is reduced by 10 feet, and it takes D6 x your Proficiency slashing damage the first time on each turn it moves 1 foot or more without teleporting. The target or any creature that can reach it can use its action to remove the brambles with a successful Strength (Athletics) check against your Arcane Shot save DC. Otherwise, the brambles last for 1 minute or until you use this option again.</p>",
